## 📡 SSE Event Types (what flows through the stream)

```
status          → "Loading file into DuckDB..."
quality_before  → { score, rows, cols, null_cells }
operation       → { column, operation, strategy, rationale, polars_code }
operation_skipped → { column, reason }
quality_after   → { score, rows_after, improvement, columns_dropped }
preview         → { columns[], rows[] }
done            → pipeline complete
error           → something failed
```

